  triage:title "RULE-010 raw 'team-lead' role literal in test_hermes_adapter.py" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-graft-python/tests/test_hermes_adapter.py lines 58 and 62 hardcode the reserved role literal 'team-lead' raw instead of a ROLE_TEAM_LEAD constant, violating RULE-010 (no raw reserved-role literals in tests). Required correction: define one ROLE_TEAM_LEAD constant and reference it at both the fixture and assertion sites." ;
